From: rnsbox <rnsbox@localhost>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 01:32:21 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] ramdisk: 64bit overlay for SDK_VER=64bit rootfs packing

pack_rootfs merges ramdisk/rootfs/overlay/${SDK_VER}; the BSP only had
32bit/glibc_riscv64/musl_riscv64. 64bit mirrors musl_riscv64 (scripts
only, no per-arch binaries; cvi_pinmux is not referenced by the RNSBox
rootfs).
